=20
it "Iron" (only in writing it now did I notice that it spells element Fe).

BTW, here's a useful table, if you know IPA:=20
http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/International_Phonetic_Alphabet_chart_for_Engl=
ish_dialects
.

